# PEP 561 marker.
#
# Its presence tells type checkers that this distribution ships inline type
# annotations and that they should be trusted rather than ignored. A library
# that annotates its code but omits this file gets silently treated as
# untyped by mypy and pyright, so its absence is a classic packaging defect.
#
# The file must be included in the wheel -- see [tool.hatch.build] in
# src/orderkit/pyproject.toml.
